    "why_memo_not_live_message": "canonical-implementor was seated but its session binding was lost to an unexpected Windows restart, and the seat did not appear in this session's peer list. A live message would have been undeliverable, and a message is not an artifact. Per CLAUDE.md's antidote-to-session-amnesia discipline the direction is recorded in the repo so the re-registered session recovers it on startup without depending on a binding that no longer exists. Seat address stable; binding disposable.",
